  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Amargasaurus cazaui has paired tall neck-spine rows supporting skin-covered ridges above a compact sauropod body. Exact sail margins, soft tissues, colour and dimensions are inferred; exposed horn sheaths are not asserted.",
    "zh": "阿马加龙 Amargasaurus cazaui 的两列高颈棘支撑覆皮嵴，位于紧凑的蜥脚类身体上方。颈帆精确边缘、软组织、颜色及尺寸为推断，不断言其具有外露角鞘。"
  },
